  "body": "This freehold end-unit townhouse enjoys an enviable outlook directly across from the reserve, offering a peaceful green outlook, abundant natural light and a wonderful sense of space. With approximately 191sqm of well-designed living, this is a home that combines everyday comfort with an easy-care lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, flowing effortlessly to the sunny deck and garden. As an end-unit, the home benefits from extra windows, more natural light and only one adjoining neighbour.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\n• Two separate living areas providing flexibility for family living, guests or working from home\r\n\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances, generous storage and seamless connection to the open-plan living spaces\r\n\r\n• Sunny outdoor entertaining area designed for low-maintenance living\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage with dedicated laundry space, excellent storage and additional off-street parking\r\n\r\nWake up to the tranquil reserve setting, enjoy an easy stroll to the Orewa Estuary Walkway, and take advantage of the convenient location close to Orewa Beach, Silverdale Shopping Centre, local schools, cafés and motorway access.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
